{"card":{"cardId":"aZ8S0","title":"Twinkle Twinkle & Other Lullabies ","userId":"yoto","slug":"","metadata":{"category":"music","description":"Ready for bed? Drift off to dreamland with Twinkle Twinkle & Other Lullabies, a soothing collection of gentle folk songs made for bedtime. From beloved traditional lullabies like “Twinkle Twinkle Little Star” to playful lyrical twists such as “Hush little baby, don’t you cry, mamma’s gonna reconnect the lost WiFi”, and peaceful original songs like “It’s Been a Long Day” and “Say Goodnight”, each track is designed to help little ones unwind after a busy day.\nSuitable for younger and older children alike, this Yoto Card blends beloved traditional lullabies with fun, modern interpretations and original songs that the whole family will enjoy.\nWith soft vocals and comforting melodies, it’s the perfect companion for cosy evenings, wind-down routines, and sweet dreams for all ages.\nMusic adaptations and originals written by Ed Hartwell, performed by Gemma Storr and Steve Pretty. ","maxAge":8,"note":"Marketplace","abridged":false,"author":"Little Woolly Vision","accents":["UK English"],"authors":["Little Woolly Vision"],"copyrights":["©2026 Woolly Vision Ltd"],"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/7akoIq5BwdWWOx01tgFdJdMnoiF6rDuqaiU_1MfTV_I"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":1636,"fileSize":18109277},"narrators":["Gemma Storr"],"creators":{"status":"approved"}},"content":{"version":"1","activity":"yoto_Player","config":{"resumeTimeout":2592000,"onlineOnly":false},"availability":"","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/7akoIq5BwdWWOx01tgFdJdMnoiF6rDuqaiU_1MfTV_I"},"playbackType":"linear","chapters":[{"duration":180,"fileSize":2162058,"key":"6-rxHSO7VA","overlayLabel":"1","title":"Twinkle Twinkle Little Star","availableFrom":null,"ambient":null,"display":{"icon16x16":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/gCgNJrpHZ186Hd1ttD-k0R2Cf38FbPW3riwe27WAiJA"},"tracks":[{"channels":"stere